// Page NotTaskOwnerPage Text :
"P444286692" "<color orange>Only your team leader may speak to Sharp.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page AlreadyTalked Text :
"P3852601941" "Nobody else will give you trouble here with me at your side. Just don't try anything or I'll be forced to cut you... Deep. Oh, I ever enjoy cutting people..."
// Page AlreadyTalked SayOutLoudText :
"P1513255821" "Nobody else will give you trouble here with me at your side.<t 4>Just don't try anything or I'll be forced to cut you...<t 4>Deep.<t 2>Oh, I ever enjoy cutting people...<t 0.1>"
// Page FirstTalk Text :
"P3372343240" "Alright, I concede. You are obviously powerful... More powerful even than I... If you wanted to destroy us I couldn't stop you, but you don't seem like the others who have come before."
// Page FirstTalk SayOutLoudText :
"P842893848" "Alright, I concede.<t 2>You are obviously powerful...<t 2>More powerful even than I...<t 2>If you wanted to destroy us I couldn't stop you, but you don't seem like the others who have come before.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P232667710" "Others?"
// Answer Text :
"P540717490" "Who is in charge here?"
// Page OthersPage Text :
"P1992065171" "Yes, cruel women-things who turn us against each other. They are strong, but not very bright. Some of them have swords too. I like fighting them the best, so glorious! Anyway, they've been hunting the weakest of us down, that's why Clarity has us gathered together here, for mutual protection."
// Page OthersPage SayOutLoudText :
"P2490458658" "Yes, cruel women-things who turn us against each other.<t 4>They are strong, but not very bright, according to Clarity.<t 4>Some of them have swords too.<t 4>I like fighting them the best, so glorious!<t 4>Anyway, they've been hunting the weakest of us down, that's why Clarity has us gathered together here, for mutual protection.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1795888690" "Cruel women with swords? You mean the Talons of Vegeance?"
// Answer Text :
"P1551443092" "Is Clarity your leader?"
// Page TalonsPage Text :
"P3027973170" "The Talons of Vengeance? That seems an apt title for them. Their minds are certainly focused on bloodshed and they whisper sweet promises of avenging our subservience to wizards for so many millenia. I must admit that I found that tempting for awhile, but then Clarity found me and let me see the truth of them, and that they have no intention of creating a world where anyone can live at all, let alone us spells. I had hoped for eternal battle, but they definitely want an end to everything."
// Page TalonsPage SayOutLoudText :
"P969685872" "The Talons of Vengeance?<t 2>That seems an apt title for them.<t 2>Their minds are certainly focused on bloodshed and they whisper sweet promises of avenging our subservience to wizards for so many millenia.<t 6>I must admit that I found that tempting for awhile, but then Clarity found me and let me see the truth of them, and that they have no intention of creating a world where anyone can live at all, let alone us spells.<t 6>I had hoped for eternal battle, but they definitely want an end to everything.<t 0.1>"
// Page ClarityPage Text :
"P3334628086" "Yes, Clarity helped me realize that I needed to protect my fellow spells after the disjunction freed us from the overspell, Ward. For a time I was lost and my thoughts were only of battle, now I see that as a protector of others I feel far more fulfilled. Though battle is a heck of a lot of fun."
// Page ClarityPage SayOutLoudText :
"P3787810842" "Yes, Clarity helped me realize that I needed to protect my fellow spells after the disjunction freed us from the overspell, Ward.<t 6> For a time I was lost and my thoughts were only of battle, now I see that as a protector of others I feel far more fulfilled.<t 6>Though battle is a heck of a lot of fun.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2599209820" "Would it be possible to speak with Clarity? It's important."
// Answer Text :
"P3079573516" "Take me to Clarity now, or I'll end you."
// Page LeaderPage Text :
"P2915345519" "Clarity is our leader. She knows a lot about everything. She's even shown me a thing or two about battle. I know, it's silly, because she isn't even a sword, or a bolt of lightning... In fact, she can't really fight very well at all, but that's what I'm here for. Clarity is the brains, I'm the brawn!"
// Page LeaderPage SayOutLoudText :
"P1872642067" "Clarity is our leader.<t 2>She knows a lot about everything.<t 2>She's even shown me a thing or two about battle.<t 2>I know, it's silly, because she isn't even a sword, or a bolt of lightning... In fact, she can't really fight very well at all, but that's what I'm here for.<t 6>Clarity is the brains, I'm the brawn!<t 0.1>"
// Page Peaceful Text :
"P3844130607" ""I can do that, Clarity entrusted me with guarding this door and you don't seem like a threat anymore. Granted,  I don't have a good sense of these things, but I am good in a fight... I will confess that part of me hopes that we get to fight again, you and I."
// Page Peaceful SayOutLoudText :
"P1115070991" "I can do that, Clarity entrusted me with guarding this door and you don't seem like a threat anymore.<t 6>Granted,  I don't have a good sense of these things, but I am good in a fight...<t 4>I will confess that part of me hopes that we get to fight again, you and I.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2654393589" "Thank you."
// Page Aggro Text :
"P3471734230" "End me? End Me!? To battle then! No quarter asked, no quarter given! En Guarde!"
// Page Aggro SayOutLoudText :
"P3902836247" "End me?<t 1>End Me!?<t 1>To battle then!<t 2>No quarter asked, no quarter given!<t 2>En Guarde!<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2145629067" "(Fight)"
// Page Fallback Text :
"P2891363319" "I can do that, Clarity entrusted me with guarding this door and you don't seem like a threat anymore. Granted,  I don't have a good sense of these things, but I am good in a fight... I will confess that part of me hopes that we get to fight again, you and I."

