// Dialog - ClarityDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotTaskOwnerPage Text :
"P2891040337" "<color orange>Only your team leader may speak to Clarity.</color>"
// Page ClarityFinishedPage Text :
"P2456391320" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}, but we will not go back. Tell Spellfather to find his own path. If he truly cares then he'll let us go. Who knows, maybe some of us will come back willingly..."
// Page TalonsDefeatedPage Text :
"P1482975368" "Thank you, {HeroName}. If... If Spellfather hadn't sent you I'm afraid we might not have survived that... Still... I can't live under his roof any longer, I'm a free spell now, and if he really loves us he'd realize that he has to let us choose our own path.<br><br>We've never had freedom before, {HeroName}, tell Spellfather that, and tell him I hope that he finds his own path as well. The Midnight Mansion will survive without us, and it will survive even without him if he just lets it."
// Page TalonsDefeatedPage SayOutLoudText :
"P3289246785" "Thank you, {HeroName}.<t 2>If... If Spellfather hadn't sent you I'm afraid we might not have survived that...<t 4>Still... I can't live under his roof any longer, I'm a free spell now, and if he really loves us he'd realize that he has to let us choose our own path.<t 6>We've never had freedom before, {HeroName}, tell Spellfather that, and tell him I hope that he finds his own path as well.<t 6>The Midnight Mansion will survive without us, and it will survive even without him if he just lets it.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2049393606" "I don't think Ward will like that, but I'll tell him."
// Answer Text :
"P352160075" "I'll tell Ward your decision. But be careful, the Talons won't stop."
// Page OpeningPage Text :
"P3878611404" "Did Sharp let you through?"
// Answer Text :
"P3706469468" "Yes, Sharp let me pass."
// Answer Text :
"P1195653070" "Uh, yeah, Sharp let me pass."
// Answer Text :
"P3884584448" "Actually, I destroyed Sharp. He was incapable of protecting himself or you."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1772444135" "Oh... I see, you bested him in combat. Very impressive, I'm sure his ego will be stinging over that for some time. Well, nothing like defeat to sharpen one's rough edges, wouldn't you say?"
// Page Page2 SayOutLoudText :
"P3784093487" "Oh... I see, you bested him in combat.<t 2>Very impressive, I'm sure his ego will be stinging over that for some time.<t 4>Well, nothing like defeat to sharpen one's rough edges, wouldn't you say?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1316685569" "Your insight is keen, but I'm not here to talk about Sharp."
// Page GoodPage Text :
"P1401828726" "Oh, I see. Well then, how can I help you?"
// Page GoodPage SayOutLoudText :
"P3078055276" "Oh, I see. Well then, how can I help you?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P712062648" "Ward sent me, he wants you and the other spells to come back home."
// Page GoodPage2 Text :
"P76641195" "Ward? Oh, you must mean Spellfather.<br><br>I'm sorry, {HeroName}, but I can't do that. We spells have never had freedom before. If we were to ignore this chance to experience this gift then it would be a tragedy. Perhaps in time some will choose to return, perhaps even I will if things get too dangerous, but I must try to live my own life.<br><br>I hope you understand."
// Page GoodPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P3130322773" "Ward?<t 1>Oh, you must mean Spellfather.<t 3>I'm sorry, {HeroName}, but I can't do that.<t 3>We spells have never had freedom before.<t 2>If we were to ignore this chance to experience this gift then it would be a tragedy.<t 4>Perhaps in time some will choose to return, perhaps even I will if things get too dangerous, but I must try to live my own life.<t 6>I hope you understand.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2469742765" "Of course. What should I tell Ward though?"
// Answer Text :
"P2808878329" "Yeah, I don't think Ward will like that."
// Page GoodPage3 Text :
"P3756843529" "Tell him that we are perfectly safe without...<br><br>!<br><br>Wait, something is happening! We are under attack again. {HeroName}, you should leave here, this is not your fight."
// Page GoodPage3 SayOutLoudText :
"P4272689391" "Tell him that we are perfectly safe without...<t 3>!<t 1>Wait, something is happening!<t 2>We are under attack again.<t 3> {HeroName}, you should leave here, this is not your fight.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1559541811" "Like hell it isn't, if the Talons are here, I'm fighting!"
// Page BadPage Text :
"P1881927592" "Sharp? Sharp is destroyed!? But why? Why would you do that?"
// Page BadPage SayOutLoudText :
"P2516417579" "Sharp?<t 1>Sharp is destroyed!?<t 2>But why?<t 1>Why would you do that?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2184771857" "He picked a fight he couldn't win and paid the price for his arrogance."
// Page BadPage2 Text :
"P3141865746" "I won't deny that Sharp had a poor sense for that sort of thing. But if you destroyed him then why are you here? Are you with those cruel women who have been preying on my brothers and sisters?"
// Page BadPage2 SayOutLoudText :
"P196526305" "I won't deny that Sharp had a poor sense for that sort of thing.<t 3>But if you destroyed him then why are you here?<t 3>Are you with those cruel women who have been preying on my brothers and sisters?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P134687804" "I'm not with the Talons, Ward sent me to bring you back."
// Page BadPage3 Text :
"P3290377675" "Ward? Oh, you must mean Spellfather.<br><br>Tell <i>Ward</i> that we are perfectly safe without...<br><br>!<br><br>Wait, something is happening! We are under attack again. {HeroName}, without Sharp we're defenseless. Please, help us!"
// Page BadPage3 SayOutLoudText :
"P1887451204" "Ward?<t 1>Oh, you must mean Spellfather.<t 3>Tell Ward that we are perfectly safe without...<t 3>!<t 1>Wait, something is happening!<t 3>We are under attack again.<t 2> {HeroName}, without Sharp we're defenseless.<t 3>Please, help us!<t 0.1>"
