// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2155307298" "The sizzle of ozone hangs in the air. A great magical battle has taken place here recently."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P4176397317" "Cloud of Ice"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P554607905" "<t 3>I dunno... I mean, I do like strength..."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3792244085" "Come here, I promise I wont frostbite!"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_NAME :
"P1791882329" "Huntress"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P264080335" "Your first victim."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3285475549" "Spiritualist"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2613432017" "Yes, feel the anger flow through you. Let it give you strength!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1414918137" "Hey there, beautiful. Mind if I tag along?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P3561866797" "Fireball"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1886771472" "<t 4>Nobody is my friend?<t 3>Then everything will be ash!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1492524294" "<t 2>Burn, Non-friends!<t 2>BURN!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P923427294" "There are no friends, little flame, only enemies!"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2412515704" "Now, show us your power, little one!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P167245087" "Zealot"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2542698014" "Whoa, those ladies were NOT friendly. Do you want to be my friend?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P233167312" "Lightning Storm"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4277444851" "They try to contain me, to use me...?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2767029281" "Charge!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P725547338" "Oracle"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2494785030" "<t 3>None can ever contain you again, let your power go free!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1703167685" "<t 3>Yes, together we will destroy {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2128920744" "Hey, you freed me! Can I follow your lead?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_NAME :
"P1957966595" "Ball of Light"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2195197173" "Hello friends! I love you all so much!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2498424962" "More friends!"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_NAME :
"P4255105118" "Banshee"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1133456306" "Gah! These balls of light are infuriating!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1543679083" "Kill it before it heals {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2495003089" "Oh no, you're hurt."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3671262806" "Stop hurting each other."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3808854102" "Here, let me help you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2766916380" "I do so love to help others!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1723372635" "Alexandria"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P386765860" "That's the last of them.<t 3>We have enough spell energy now to complete the ritual.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2799037109" "So, {HeroName} wishes to sacrifice {hero.gender=male himself|herself} in order to see vengeance served?<t 4>How brave.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2140915422" "Why do you fight against us when you could be the greatest of us?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1930954483" "Don't you see? The world is sick and we are the cure."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3185066422" "Once the coven is restored the prison shall be opened."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4274592033" "Killing me will solve nothing."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P784373054" "Th... thank... you..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2968589196" "You could do so much more working with us, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDefeatTalons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1073090179" "Defeat Alexandria"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1371083280" "Ritual? Coven? Prison?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2400146343" "You did what you could to save the Animus Arcana from the lure of the Talons, but you were too late to save all of their lives. At least those who died won't live on in the service of those wicked creatures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2929185746" "The Talons of Vengeance must be stopped, {HeroName}!<br><br>We must find out what my spell children died for.<br><br>Why are they stealing my spell children?<br>What coven do they speak of?<br>What prison do they refer to?<br>What ritual are they intending to cast?<br><br>The answers to these questions will lead us to them and tell us how to stop them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NadiaDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1217300109" "Be ready for the fight of ya life, {HeroName}. Where we be goin' is a place of great spiritual powah, and I dannae doubt dat the Talons 'ave already corrupted it for der own uses."
// Answer Text :
"P3550355693" "There's little time, let's go! (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P353792909" "Fools rush in, give me time to prepare. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P614578464" "Within my knowledge there is no mention of a coven, a prison, or a ritual relating to either. They are unknown to me.<br><br>Perhaps there are others who know what these things mean. <color orange>Montague Castanella is well versed in such things, starting with him would be wise.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1636152971" "I'll ask around."
// SendOffString :
"P1775933824" "Thank you, {HeroName}. All that I know is coming undone and I fear that soon I shall have no purpose. All I have ever known is to protect the Midnight Mansion, and to nurture my spell children. Without them I am lost. Without the mansion I am nothing."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1798704279" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Broken Bindings</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3520162478" "Talk to Montague about the Talons plans"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2069101907" "Perhaps Montague Castanella's breadth of knowledge will include something about this coven, prison, or ritual."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2786165565" "There were once many covens, {HeroName}, but <color red>Emperor Cole</color> saw to it that they were scattered or destroyed. Of this prison, however, I am afraid that the Talons of Vengeance may be referring to <color yellow>The Eternal Prison</color>.<br><br>The Eternal Prison is a place where wicked souls are sent to be locked away forever, their power and presence kept sealed away from all others so as not to spread their poison. Mind you, {HeroName}, this is no place such as Tartarus or Hell. This is a place for the supremely wicked, those who would defy the Fates themselves and seek to overthrow the cosmic order of things.<br><br><i>If</i> indeed the Talons are seeking to open this prison, then unspeakable evil will be unleashed upon the world. Unfortunately, Tremaine's Manual of the Dead makes no mention of how to find the prison save for earning a place in there for yourself.<br><br>Even if you could find it, the prison is said to be guarded by an order or warriors known as <color red>The Black Knights</color>. They are the oathbound to defend the prison, and they know neither fear nor pain.<br><br>Perhaps the Black Knights are aware of this ritual the Talons seek, though I wouldn't recommend you go asking them about it. Another denizen of the spirit world would be more approachable..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3336731921" "Talk to Whispering Coyote"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4006139934" "I believe Whispering Coyote's knowledge of the spirit realm would be more helpful at this juncture than my one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3565703683" "Ki-yi-yi-yi!<br><br>{HeroName}, good to see you again. What seems to be the problem?<br><br>Ki-yi!? Ki-ki-yi!<br><br>Oh, you don't want anything to do with the Black Knights, {HeroName}. If you thought the Drudges were bad, the Black Knights are forty-nine times worse, I say. All honor and duty, never any time for a bit of fun, and I don't blame them what with those they're charged with keeping under lock and key. I wouldn't worry about the Talons of Vengeance getting anywhere near the Eternal Prison. Nobody's ever broken out of there before, and I'd bet my front paw against even Sleepy Owl that nobody ever will.<br><br>Ki-yi!<br><br>Now, if I were you, I'd go and talk to Nadia about covens and rituals. If you ask me, she's your best lead. She used to be in a coven once... didn't she?<br><br>Ki-yi?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2424122939" "Talk to Mistress Nadia"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3110259467" "I admit I am unaware of anyone named Mistress Nadia, though Montague Castanella has begun updating my knowledge to include a variety of potential rituals that the Talons of Vengeance might utilize."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2522660123" "Greetings chil'... oh, my! The Loas ebb and flow 'bout you like a hurricane. Tell me, what troubles you?<br><br>What? The Talons are seekin' ta bring back a coven, you say?<br><br>No... They could nae mean... and yet...<br><br>{HeroName}, I tink the Talons might be tryin' ta resurrect <color red>The Ravenwing Cabal</color>! Serene brought the Talons of Vengeance into dis world in the first place, and now dat she's dead mayhaps the Talons be lookin' ta her old coven for a new leader.<br><br>But... what would the Ravenwing Cabal know about the Eternal Prison? In the past we tried ta contact entities dat were supposed ta be locked within, ta gleen secrets from dem, but t'was always ta no avail... unless...<br><br>{HeroName}, could it be dat the Talons know of a way ta get into da prison because... because dat is where dey came from in the first place!?<br><br>Perhaps dat is the ritual dey speak of. The ritual Serene invoked ta free dem in the first place would require a witch of Serene's tremendous power, or... a coven of her sistahs!<br><br>We'd bettah hurry. I know where the Talons are goin' in order to conduct the ritual!<br><br><color orange>{HeroName}, if you have any allies you can call upon, now would be the time to do so.</color><br><br><color yellow>This mission is of higher difficulty than normal, consider bringing another player along to help.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2454391017" "Stop the Resurrection of the Ravenwing Cabal"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3682155927" "Resurrection spells are certainly designed to bring back the dead.<br><br>If the Ravenwing Cabal is necessary to conduct a ritual that may grant the Talons of Vengeance access to the Eternal Prison, then it would be best to stop them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1564090080" "The ritual has already begun. For just a moment the oddly soothing chanting of the Talons threatens to overtake you, but you shake it and press on."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P697602306" "Stop the Ritual!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P908070003" "Mistress Nadia"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2940430599" "Ungh...<t 2>{HeroName}... I dannae tink it be wise fer me to continue with yea...<t 5>The Talons are... singing ta me...<t 3>It's taking every-ting I got ta keep dem at bay...<t 3>Go on without me...<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P488327316" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>By the earth goddess...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>Look at what the Talons 'ave done ta dis cavern!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>Dese carvings, Dese symbols...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>Dey are familiar but I cannae place dem.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>It's cuneiform, but I cannae recall dere meanin'...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>Divinity, I tink...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>I fear the Talons seek ta unleash somethin' truly monstrous from the Eternal Prison.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>An ancient evil best lef' forgotten.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor White>You had bettah hurry!<t 0.1>"

