// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4237466580" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>They are coming, {HeroName}. Buy me the time to adjust the Mansion's defenses to repel them..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1234905549" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>They are altering the protective wards! They're trying to turn them against you!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Quickly, there is no choice, you must destroy the protective wards before it is too late!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1347877132" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Unfortunately, with the wards destroyed I sense the Talons of Vengeance approaching!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Do everything you can to repel them."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2619099379" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>It's over... {HeroName}...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>I see clearly now that in order to once more be with all of my spell children... I must join them!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>I must join them on the quest for VENGEANCE!!!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3096473137" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Spellfather!? Oh no... {HeroName}, it's Clarity, tell me I'm not too late!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>There is one chance to save spellfather, {HeroName}, but I will need your help to do it.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Meet me at the front gate, I'll need you to get me as close to the Reflection Pool as you can!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1826163771" "<t=2 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Spellfather...<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Ah, Clarity, my child. You've returned to me at long last...<t=2 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>No, Spellfather...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>I'm sorry... But this is the only way to save you... to save everyone...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>What? Clarity!<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Spellfather... Remember me...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>No, my daughter, do not do this!<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Good bye, everyone...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Spell - Of - CLARITY!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Nooooo!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3029318011" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>I am free now...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Clarity has gifted me with all that she was...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Her thoughts, her memories, her freedom...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>She... She sacrificed herself... To save me...<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>I'll not let her sacrifice be in vain!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color Goldenrod><bgcolor Black>Draw them to me, {HeroName}, we'll stop these sorceresses together!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1416522576" "I shall reduce you all to ash!"

