// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3216576701" "Lady Atella"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2870196716" "Lady Atella is a member of the Ravenwing Cabal, resurrected by the Talons of Vengeance, and hell bent on exacting her revenge against Diabolique, Emperor Cole and the world. Atella's specialty is counter magic, a skill which she has used to breach the Midnight Mansion's defenses to turn Ward against you."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P486372809" "No matter, the Overspell cannot protect you now, {HeroName}! Now my sisters and I will finish the job!"
// BOSS_AI_INACTIVE :
"P452989430" "Meddling child. You sacrificed yourself to save the very one who would enslave you?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2015945964" "I do not fear death, {HeroName}, for I have already died once!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1264413305" "Pain, anguish, all of these things only give me more strength!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2415497187" "Do you really think you can stop this?"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P147081509" "The world will burn, {HeroName}. Struggling will only make it burn faster!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1477086076" "You... Have... Freed... Me..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3328698529" "<em victory>Such a pity, you could have made a valuable ally."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2202901085" "Where my sisters failed, I shall not."

