// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P473071889" "Montague Castanella"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3242397866" "Understood, now it is my turn to lend my hand in the defense of the mansion!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2010564494" "I see that they mean serious business."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P630733881" "My combat skills are not as rusty as they once were."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3812174201" "This fight is not going well."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2852983694" "I can't keep up this pace!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3760595356" "I'm sorry, but I must retreat!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P1990601347" "<em victory>Victorious!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2736729196" "Master Winkley"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3813408861" "If we fight together then we will not fail."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P189527738" "Pah, barely a scratch!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2891933151" "So, you want to play, huh?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4280845219" "You may have bloodied me, but the fight is far from over!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4199747329" "Montague, you're up and I'm out!<t 2>My spells are failing!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2755167312" "<em victory>You cannot withstand my matchless mystical might!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3921176614" "Reanimated Acolyte"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P773973006" "You successfully defended the Midnight Mansion from the Talons of Vengeance, but at great cost."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2599704479" "The Mansion is safe once more, but... at such a cost...<br><br>{HeroName}, had it not been for the actions of Clarity I would have likely destroyed the Midnighters, and all that I am... or was.<br><br>The Talons of Vengeance twisted me into an instrument of death and hate, but Clarity... Clarity saved me. She saved us all...<br><br>I understood for the briefest of moments, while the Talons were losing their hold on me and Clarity was with me, what it was to be free. What Clarity was fighting for. What the Talons of Vengeance seek to take from us all.<br><br>I saw the plans of the Talons of Vengeance as well, if only the very surface. It involves the Black Knights. Clarity's last memories also included the Black Knights. Her thoughts of them flowed through me and brought me back.<br><br><color orange>There is a Black Knight named Bedwyr.</color> He was Clarity's first true friend.<br><br>I sense in him a great and powerful ally.<br><br>Seek out Bedwyr, tell him that the Talons of Vengeance plan to breach the Eternal Prison, and that he does not have to stand against them alone any longer.<br><br>Tell him of Clarity's sacrifice and let him know that if ever he is in need, I, Ward, Spellfather of Clarity and the Animus Arcana, and Overspell of the Midnight Mansion, shall stand by his side!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
